<title>FRANCE: Trichet says French 1997 deficit can be reduced.</title>
<headline>Trichet says French 1997 deficit can be reduced.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of France governor Jean-Claude Trichet said on Friday he believed that the country's deficit 1997 could be reduced but it depended on decisions being taken.</p>
<p>&quot;Clearly we can lower the deficit, it's a question of the decisions to be taken to bring it down,&quot; Trichet told Europe 1 radio.</p>
</text>
